OL,3,AUS and China discuss AI safety plan
OL,4,Aahead of Trump-Xi summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTop US and Chinese officials have
OL,7,Fdiscussed creating a new "notification
OL,8,Fmechanism" for AI incidents that could
OL,9,Faffect national security, Treasury
OL,10,FSecretary Scott Bessent told reporters
OL,11,Fon Sunday.
OL,13,FBessent made the comments after what he
OL,14,Fcalled "successful" talks with Chinese
OL,15,FVice Premier He Lifeng in New York.
OL,17,FThe meeting came as US President Donald
OL,18,FTrump and his Chinese counterpart Xi
OL,19,FJinping are due to hold a summit in
OL,20,FWashington later this week.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
